<title>USA: AptarGroup Inc Q3 net, sales higher.</title>
<headline>AptarGroup Inc Q3 net, sales higher.</headline>
<dateline>CRYSTAL LAKE, Ill. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter	Nine Months</p>
<p>					1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net Sales		    $155,917 $140,630 $459,918 $418,655</p>
<p> Cost of Sales		 101,774   90,753  298,347  267,996</p>
<p>Selling General and</p>
<p>   Administrative	     25,849   24,194   77,022   71,957</p>
<p> Depreciation/Amortization  12,727   11,038   36,471   32,334</p>
<p> Operating Income	     15,567   14,645   48,078   46,368</p>
<p>Other:</p>
<p>   Interest Expense	  (1,623)  (1,571)  (5,058)  (4,435)</p>
<p>   Interest Income		 168	125	810	632</p>
<p>   Equity/Income of Affiliates 325	320	892    1,722</p>
<p>   Minority Interests	   (46)     (37)    (196)    (116)</p>
<p>   Other Income - net	    137	411    1,172	757</p>
<p>     Total		     (1,039)    (752)  (2,380)  (1,440)</p>
<p> Income Before Taxes	  14,528   13,893   45,698   44,928</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes  5,521    5,418   17,191   16,901</p>
<p> Net Income			9,007    8,475   28,507   28,027</p>
<p> Net Per Share		     .50	.47     1.59     1.56</p>
<p> Average Number of Shares   17,941   17,919   17,936   17,917</p>
<p>		(In Thousands, Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Acquisitions completed in the 1995 fourth quarter added $4.9 million to 1996 third quarter sales and added $14.9 million to 1996 nine months sales.</p>
<p>		    Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
